---
description: Dexie schema, migrations and data conventions
globs: src/db/**,src/lib/backup.ts,src/sync/**
alwaysApply: false
---
- NEVER modify an existing `this.version(n)` block in src/db/db.ts. Add `version(n+1).stores({...}).upgrade(...)` touching only changed tables.
- Types live in src/db/types.ts; update docs/03-DATA-MODEL.md in the same change.
- When adding a table, add it to ALL_TABLES (backup/export) and bump BACKUP_VERSION if the shape changes.
- Dates: `dateKey()` local YYYY-MM-DD. Never toISOString().slice(0,10).
- IDs via `uid()`.
- Write a fake-indexeddb test for every migration that upgrades data.
